        {
          "text": "Then the third angel blew his trumpet. A large star, burning like a torch, dropped from the sky and fell on a third of the rivers and on the springs of water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.8.10"
